    <!--
      Kubuno.Cargo/Kubuno.Launch are netstandard2.0 (see their own csproj comments): referencing
      them here, rather than only from the pure test projects, is what actually drives the Cargo
      workspace integration (1b) and launch/debug (1c) at runtime. BuiltProjectOutputGroupDependencies
